 },
 "notes": "The baseline. Five hits deep at ninety centimetres of reach: the class is a bet that you can live inside everything else's minimum range.\n\nLineage: wrapped — Bound linen and Hist-bonded talon alike. FST has four weapons, so it is a single-lineage class: two lineages cannot both reach the three members a signature weapon needs (see why_lineages).\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 35.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
}
